# Frequency conversion between gigahertz and megahertz

Verifies direct conversion between gigahertz and megahertz in both directions. Gigahertz converts to megahertz with an integer scale, while megahertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion.

>>> source
forward_whole: int = 1ghz
print(forward_whole->to(mhz))
forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5ghz
print(forward_fractional->to(mhz))
backward_whole: int = 1mhz
print(backward_whole->to(ghz))
backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5mhz
print(backward_fractional->to(ghz))

<<< stdout
1000mhz
1500.0mhz
0.001ghz
0.0015ghz

<<< stderr
